      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I understand that you're feeling trapped and frustrated, but it's important to remember that everyone has their own unique path and purpose in life. It's okay to feel disappointed, but don't let it consume you. Instead, try to focus on the things that bring you joy and fulfillment, even if they're not as grand as you initially imagined. You don't have to leave a mark on the world to have a meaningful life. Sometimes, the smallest acts of kindness and love can have the biggest impact. And who knows, maybe there's a hidden talent or passion waiting to be discovered. Don't give up on yourself just yet. There's still so much potential within you, and you never know what the future holds. Keep pushing forward, and don't be afraid to take risks. You might be surprised at what you can achieve.",
      "source": "target",
